faqs:
  - q: How is this different from staff augmentation?
    a: A squad shows up with a tech lead and a team that has worked together before. Staff aug is individual placements. Squads ship features against a backlog; individuals join yours.
  - q: Who manages the squad?
    a: Our tech lead manages delivery. Your product owner or engineering manager sets priorities. Weekly review, bi-weekly retro, monthly business review.
  - q: Can we change the shape mid-engagement?
    a: Yes. Common. Scale up by one engineer with 2 weeks notice. Scale down with one sprint of wind-down.
  - q: What about IP and ownership?
    a: You own all IP. Code pushed to your repos. Documents in your workspace. We keep nothing.
  - q: Who is accountable for outcomes?
    a: Our tech lead for delivery. Your product owner for priorities. Shared accountability written into the statement of work.
